    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flowerbots</strong> is a chill and bouncy idler incremental game set in minimalist and abstract garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are two teams of bots in the game: planters and harvesters, and you command them both, so it is your duty to keep the garden balanced and as efficient as possible.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prestige system.</strong>\u00a0Progress between runs in a roguelite style, with randomized upgrades within runs and a prestige progression outside of them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physical simulation.</strong>\u00a0Explore the bots with their own features, abilities and movement styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30+ anomalies to conquer.</strong>\u00a0Adjust your strategies and adapt your builds to solve the mini-boss levels that we call Anomalies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A new take on idler incremental games.</strong>\u00a0This time with a bouncy simulation, which makes all your strategies and builds physical with a touch of chaos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u00a0enjoy optimizing a small physical simulation, theorizing about builds, and watching your plan unfold while numbers go up, then this game is for you.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flowerbots</strong> is a chill and bouncy idler incremental game set in minimalist and abstract garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are two teams of bots in the game: planters and harvesters, and you command them both, so it is your duty to keep the garden balanced and as efficient as possible.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prestige system.</strong>\u00a0Progress between runs in a roguelite style, with randomized upgrades within runs and a prestige progression outside of them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physical simulation.</strong>\u00a0Explore the bots with their own features, abilities and movement styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30+ anomalies to conquer.</strong>\u00a0Adjust your strategies and adapt your builds to solve the mini-boss levels that we call Anomalies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A new take on idler incremental games.</strong>\u00a0This time with a bouncy simulation, which makes all your strategies and builds physical with a touch of chaos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u00a0enjoy optimizing a small physical simulation, theorizing about builds, and watching your plan unfold while numbers go up, then this game is for you.</p>",
